<title>CHILE: Chile's Colbun 9-mo net slides.</title>
<headline>Chile's Colbun 9-mo net slides.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>State power utility Colbun Machicura SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year compared with the same period 1995.</p>
<p>			  9-mo 1996	  9-mo 1995</p>
<p> Net profit		   8.83    profit  15.90</p>
<p> Operating profit	  10.62    profit  17.44</p>
<p> Non-operating loss	 0.22    profit   1.30</p>
<p> Total sales		 36.38		40.80</p>
<p>NOTE:All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
